- Two assertions in `yin/repl/store_test.cljc:704` and `:709`.
- One in `driver_test.cljc:918` (`post-cycle-inbox-refusal-survives-result-normalization-test`, expected `:yin.k/unsatisfied`, got `:yin.k/ok`). That is the other session's in-flight file.

Lint is clean on the four edited test files. I did not run the Dart lane, since it wasn't requested.

**Java version:** in this shell `clj` uses Java 17, and the Node build needs 21, so I ran it with `mise exec java@21 -- …`. I couldn't run `mise trust` because it needs your approval, which is probably why the worktree's `mise.toml` (Java 21 first) isn't active here.

